    },
    {
      "card_ids": ["C12"],
      "claim": "Soticlestat has a low absolute oral bioavailability of 12.6%, but it is structurally distant from the query (large piperidine/pyridine system) and has low transferability, so it provides only weak contradictory evidence.",
